{"id":"244943f88396309f","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-integer.md","title":"Integer","display":"df-integer — Integer","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-integer","aliases":["58-df-integer"],"display":"df-integer — Integer","depends_on":["[[58-df-natural-number]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-integer"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-integer</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-integer — Integer"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0adc4e3c996ff726\" href=\"?note=0adc4e3c996ff726\" title=\"58-df-natural-number\">58-df-natural-number</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> (natural-number set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0adc4e3c996ff726\" href=\"?note=0adc4e3c996ff726\" title=\"58-df-natural-number\">58-df-natural-number</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\omega\\times\\omega\">\\(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\omega\\times\\omega\\)</span> (integer representative)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}integer} \\vdash \\mathbb Z\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left\\{\\langle c,d\\rangle\\in\\omega\\times\\omega\\mid a+d=b+c\\right\\}\\;\\middle|\\;\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\omega\\times\\omega\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}integer} \\vdash \\mathbb Z\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left\\{\\langle c,d\\rangle\\in\\omega\\times\\omega\\mid a+d=b+c\\right\\}\\;\\middle|\\;\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\omega\\times\\omega\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{Z}\">\\(\\mathbb{Z}\\)</span> is the set of integers constructed as equivalence classes of pairs of natural numbers</li>\n<li>The integers form a commutative ring with unity under addition</li>\n<li>Each integer is represented as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[(a, b)]\">\\([(a, b)]\\)</span> where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a, b \\in \\omega\">\\(a, b \\in \\omega\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[(a, b)] = [(c, d)]\">\\([(a, b)] = [(c, d)]\\)</span> iff <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a + d = b + c\">\\(a + d = b + c\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-natural-number","status":"resolved","id":"0adc4e3c996ff726","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-natural-number]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-natural-number","status":"resolved","id":"0adc4e3c996ff726","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega$ (natural-number set, see [[58-df-natural-number]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\omega\\times\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}integer} \\vdash \\mathbb Z\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left\\{\\langle c,d\\rangle\\in\\omega\\times\\omega\\mid a+d=b+c\\right\\}\\;\\middle|\\;\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\omega\\times\\omega\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb{Z}","display":false},{"tex":"[(a, b)]","display":false},{"tex":"a, b \\in \\omega","display":false},{"tex":"[(a, b)] = [(c, d)]","display":false},{"tex":"a + d = b + c","display":false}],"bytes":865,"backlink